---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import PromptBuilder from '../components/interactive/PromptBuilder';
---

<MainLayout title="Prompt Builder - Static AI Hub">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto pb-20">
    
    <header class="mb-12 text-center pt-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold mb-4 bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-purple-600 dark:from-blue-400 dark:to-purple-400">
        AI Prompt Builder 🛠️
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Rakit prompt berkualitas tinggi dengan struktur yang teruji. <br/>
        Prompt yang jelas = Hasil AI yang akurat.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="mb-12 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 border border-blue-100 dark:border-blue-800 rounded-xl p-6 md:p-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-300">
        <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm">?</span>
        Cara Menggunakan Builder Ini
      </h2>
      
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="relative pl-4 border-l-2 border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-700 transition-transform hover:scale-105 duration-300">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-1">1. Tentukan Persona</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            Jangan biarkan AI menebak. Beri peran spesifik seperti <em>"Senior Marketing Manager"</em> agar gaya bahasanya pas.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="relative pl-4 border-l-2 border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-700 transition-transform hover:scale-105 duration-300">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-1">2. Beri Konteks & Tugas</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            Jelaskan latar belakang masalah. Semakin detail konteks, semakin relevan jawabannya.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="relative pl-4 border-l-2 border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-700 transition-transform hover:scale-105 duration-300">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-1">3. Kunci Formatnya</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            Hindari jawaban acak. Minta output spesifik seperti <em>Table, JSON,</em> atau <em>Bullet Points</em>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <PromptBuilder client:load />

  </div>
</MainLayout>